{"id":"654224","name":"凉拌豆腐皮","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/654224/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆腐皮","amount":"一张"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"小米辣","amount":"少许"},{"name":"葱","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"豆腐皮切细条。","img":"images/654224/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入沸水中，煮一下，捞出。","img":"images/654224/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜切碎，小米辣切圈。","img":"images/654224/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"葱切葱花。","img":"images/654224/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切好的蒜和小米辣一起放入碗中，加少许白芝麻、辣椒粉和孜然粉。","img":"images/654224/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"起锅烧热油，将热油倒在碗里。","img":"images/654224/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入少许生抽、蚝油和白糖拌匀。","img":"images/654224/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"浇在豆腐皮条上。","img":"images/654224/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/654224/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/654224/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"撒上葱花。","img":"images/654224/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"开吃。","img":"images/654224/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"清香爽口。","img":"images/654224/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}